y}{\\text{d}x}=2\\,\\frac{\\text{d}z}{\\text{d}x}.\n$$\n\n \n\nTherefore, equation $(∗)$ can be written as a linear equation in $z(x)$ as follows:\n\n$$\n2\\,\\frac{\\text{d}z}{\\text{d}x}+{x}^{2}z=1\n$$\n\nFinally, we write the above equation in standard form, which gives\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}z}{\\text{d}x}+\\frac{{x}^{2}}{2}\\,z=\\frac{1}{2}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, $P(x)=\\frac{{x}^{2}}{2}.$" 13194139535469 true] [17592186350757 1000 #edb/ref 17592186350758 13194139535469 true] [17592186350757 1000 #edb/ref 17592186350759 13194139535469 true] [17592186350757 1000 #edb/ref 17592186350760 13194139535469 true] [17592186350757 1000 #edb/ref 17592186350761 13194139535469 true] [17592186350757 1000 #edb/ref 17592186350762 13194139535469 true] [17592186350757 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535469 true] [17592186350757 1041 "selection" 13194139535469 true] [17592186350757 1104 #edb/ref 17592186350762 13194139535469 true] [17592186350757 1110 #uuid "6054114f-e2e5-5444-bc00-736558a64725" 13194139535469 true] [17592186350758 1034 "\\frac{x}{2}" 13194139535469 true] [17592186350758 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535469 true] [17592186350758 1111 #uuid "0b2520a3-f463-5681-90f0-2f2104ddbb97" 13194139535469 true] [17592186350759 1034 "-\\frac{3{x}^{2}}{2}" 13194139535469 true] [17592186350759 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535469 true] [17592186350759 1111 #uuid "41bbb2d4-9959-5a3f-83fc-da1644e18d6a" 13194139535469 true] [17592186350760 1034 "\\frac{2}{x}" 13194139535469 true] [17592186350760 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535469 true] [17592186350760 1111 #uuid "504cdae1-8078-53e3-8c42-8480b7b0e7ce" 13194139535469 true] [17592186350761 1034 "-\\frac{1}{2}" 13194139535469 true] [17592186350761 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535469 true] [17592186350761 1111 #uuid "2b021777-de03-5c6a-b397-99df22da23d2" 13194139535469 true] [17592186350762 1034 "\\frac{{x}^{2}}{2}" 13194139535469 true] [17592186350762 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535469 true] [17